## Build output
bin/
obj/
*.user

## Machine-local secrets (connection strings, provider keys) — never committed.
## The committed appsettings files carry empty placeholders; see Program.cs.
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Local.*.json

## SQLite database created on first run. The translation catalogues under App_Data/i18n are the
## exception: they are the seed the Translations table is filled from, so they are versioned with
## the store. A clone without them would have no strings at all.
App_Data/*
!App_Data/i18n/
App_Data/i18n/*
!App_Data/i18n/*.txt
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

## The seeded database is regenerated automatically, so it is never committed.
## Local tooling / editor state
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

## Node (only used for client-side library restoration)
node_modules/
